{"id":"PaddleSaleAlerts0001","name":"Paddle new-sale alerts → Slack, Discord & Telegram (with signature verification)","nodes":[{"id":"aab3adeb-cfc8-4a09-8ae3-b252efb6f053","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-960,-272],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":1240,"content":"## Paddle new-sale alerts → Slack, Discord & Telegram (with signature verification)\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives Paddle webhook events, verifies their HMAC signature (`Paddle-Signature: ts=…;h1=…`, SHA-256 over `ts:rawBody`, timing-safe compare), and filters for completed sales. When a valid completed sale is detected, it formats the transaction into a concise alert — showing what you actually keep after Paddle's fee, with zero-decimal currencies (JPY, KRW…) handled correctly — and sends it to Slack, Discord and Telegram in parallel.\n\nAnyone who discovers your webhook URL can POST fake \"sales\" to it. Paddle signs every request, and this workflow **rejects anything unsigned or forged** — most webhook templates skip this.\n\n### Setup steps\n\nTakes ≈5 minutes. Plain HTTP everywhere — no OAuth and no n8n credentials needed.\n\n- Open **Verify Paddle Signature** and paste your webhook secret. Find it in Paddle → Developer tools → Notifications → your destination → *Edit destination*; it starts with `pdl_ntfset_…`.\n- Copy this workflow's **Production webhook URL** into Paddle → Developer tools → Notifications → *New destination*, subscribed to `transaction.completed`. Keep the Webhook node's **Raw Body** option enabled — the signature is computed over the raw payload.\n- **Slack**: create an incoming webhook at api.slack.com/apps and paste its URL into **Post to Slack Webhook**.\n- **Discord**: channel → Settings → Integrations → Webhooks → paste the URL into **Post to Discord Webhook**.\n- **Telegram**: create a bot with @BotFather, put its token in the URL of **Post to Telegram Bot API** and your chat id in `chat_id`.\n- **Delete the channel branches you don't use**, activate the workflow, then send a test event from Paddle's notification screen or make a sandbox purchase.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the completed-sale condition or the **Build Alert Message** Code node to include different Paddle fields, currencies, customer details, or channel-specific message text."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"b2eda1ef-54b5-4966-bbf5-fb9f540a4c8b","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-408,-80],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":432,"height":320,"content":"## Receive and verify webhook\n\nAccepts incoming Paddle webhook events and verifies the Paddle signature before allowing the payload to continue."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"164c96ee-9698-44c9-870b-e4074b76e1c6","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[64,-96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":336,"content":"## Filter and format sale\n\nChecks whether the verified event represents a completed sale, then builds a friendly alert message from the transaction details."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"def37011-5e3f-4ce8-ab4e-d96f49b4e51e","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[512,-272],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":256,"height":656,"content":"## Send channel alerts\n\nFans the formatted sale alert out to Slack, Discord and Telegram. The three nodes are independent — delete the ones you don't use."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"9b1f2a70-0003-4a9e-8c11-aa0000000003","name":"When Paddle Sale Alert","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[-360,80],"webhookId":"aa61f9e0-5a1e-4d3b-9c00-000000000001","parameters":{"path":"paddle-sale-alerts","options":{"rawBody":true},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"9b1f2a70-0004-4a9e-8c11-aa0000000004","name":"Verify Paddle Signature","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[-140,80],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// === Verify the Paddle-Signature header (HMAC-SHA256 over `ts:rawBody`) ===\n// 1) Paste your webhook secret below (Paddle → Developer tools → Notifications\n//    → your destination). It starts with pdl_ntfset_… — keep it secret.\nconst WEBHOOK_SECRET = 'PASTE_YOUR_PADDLE_WEBHOOK_SECRET_HERE';\n\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst item = $input.first();\n\nif (!item.binary?.data?.data) {\n  throw new Error('Raw body missing — keep the Webhook node option \"Raw Body\" enabled.');\n}\n\nconst sigHeader = item.json.headers?.['paddle-signature'] ?? '';\nconst parts = Object.fromEntries(sigHeader.split(';').map((p) => p.split('=')));\nconst rawBody = Buffer.from(item.binary.data.data, 'base64').toString('utf8');\n\nconst expected = crypto\n  .createHmac('sha256', WEBHOOK_SECRET)\n  .update(`${parts.ts}:${rawBody}`)\n  .digest('hex');\n\nconst given = parts.h1 ?? '';\nconst valid =\n  given.length === expected.length &&\n  crypto.timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(expected), Buffer.from(given));\n\nif (!valid) {\n  throw new Error('Invalid Paddle signature — request rejected.');\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: JSON.parse(rawBody) }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"9b1f2a70-0005-4a9e-8c11-aa0000000005","name":"If Sale Completed","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[112,80],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"cond-event-type","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.event_type }}","rightValue":"transaction.completed"}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"9b1f2a70-0006-4a9e-8c11-aa0000000006","name":"Build Alert Message","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[336,64],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Build one friendly alert line from the transaction.\n// Paddle amounts are minor-unit strings ('4900' = $49.00) — except\n// zero-decimal currencies like JPY/KRW.\nconst d = $input.first().json.data ?? {};\nconst t = d.details?.totals ?? {};\nconst cur = t.currency_code ?? 'USD';\nconst zeroDecimal = ['JPY', 'KRW', 'VND', 'ISK'].includes(cur);\nconst fmt = (v) => {\n  const n = Number(v ?? 0) / (zeroDecimal ? 1 : 100);\n  return n.toLocaleString('en-US', { minimumFractionDigits: zeroDecimal ? 0 : 2, maximumFractionDigits: zeroDecimal ? 0 : 2 });\n};\n\nconst product = d.items?.map((i) => i.price?.name ?? i.price?.description).filter(Boolean).join(', ') || 'your product';\n\nconst message =\n  `💰 New Paddle sale: ${fmt(t.total)} ${cur} — ${product}\\n` +\n  `You keep ${fmt(t.earnings)} ${cur} after Paddle's fee of ${fmt(t.fee)} ${cur}.\\n` +\n  `Transaction ${d.id ?? '?'} · customer ${d.customer_id ?? '?'}`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { message } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"9b1f2a70-0007-4a9e-8c11-aa0000000007","name":"Post to Slack Webhook","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[576,-96],"parameters":{"url":"https://hooks.slack.com/services/PASTE/YOUR/SLACK_WEBHOOK","method":"POST","options":{},"sendBody":true,"bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"text","value":"={{ $json.message }}"}]}},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"9b1f2a70-0008-4a9e-8c11-aa0000000008","name":"Post to Discord Webhook","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[576,64],"parameters":{"url":"https://discord.com/api/webhooks/PASTE_YOUR_DISCORD_WEBHOOK","method":"POST","options":{},"sendBody":true,"bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"content","value":"={{ $json.message }}"}]}},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"9b1f2a70-0009-4a9e-8c11-aa0000000009","name":"Post to Telegram Bot API","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[576,224],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.telegram.org/botPASTE_YOUR_BOT_TOKEN/sendMessage","method":"POST","options":{},"sendBody":true,"bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"chat_id","value":"PASTE_YOUR_CHAT_ID"},{"name":"text","value":"={{ $json.message }}"}]}},"typeVersion":4.2}],"pinData":{},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"connections":{"If Sale Completed":{"main":[[{"node":"Build Alert Message","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Build Alert Message":{"main":[[{"node":"Post to Slack Webhook","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Post to Discord Webhook","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Post to Telegram Bot API","type":"main","index":0}]]},"When Paddle Sale Alert":{"main":[[{"node":"Verify Paddle Signature","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Verify Paddle Signature":{"main":[[{"node":"If Sale Completed","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}